WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.928 --> 00:00:13.813
Tina: How will we know when we find an ant trail?

2
00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:16.014
Brad: It won't be that hard.

3
00:00:16.894 --> 00:00:20.036
Brad: Ants have six legs, so there will be lots of footprints.

4
00:00:21.276 --> 00:00:21.977
Tina: What else?

5
00:00:27.139 --> 00:00:29.720
Brad: An ant can pull fifty times its own body weight.

6
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.202
Brad: So there may be marks from ants dragging things.

7
00:00:33.222 --> 00:00:35.984
Brad: And remember, we're really small.

8
00:00:36.004 --> 00:00:39.166
Brad: So an ant trail will be pretty big.

9
00:00:40.127 --> 00:00:41.748
It might be as big as a road.

10
00:00:42.568 --> 00:00:46.371
Tina: I hope Danny and Bello are having better luck than us.

11
00:00:48.872 --> 00:00:52.295
Danny: Bello, this is great.

12
00:00:52.755 --> 00:00:54.276
Bello: What do you mean, Danny?

13
00:00:54.296 --> 00:00:57.278
Danny: It's fun having an adventure with you!

14
00:00:57.298 --> 00:01:00.020
Danny: I thought I would never see you again.

15
00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:02.984
Bello: I'm happy to see you too.

16
00:01:03.004 --> 00:01:07.146
Bello: But I don't think the boys you shrunk are having a good time.

17
00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:08.986
Danny: You're probably right.

18
00:01:09.006 --> 00:01:10.947
Bello: I'm worried about them.

19
00:01:11.687 --> 00:01:13.327
Being a prisoner is horrible.

20
00:01:13.347 --> 00:01:16.788
Danny: I didn't mean for this to happen.

21
00:01:16.828 --> 00:01:20.349
Danny: Brad and I really were planning to unshrink them.

22
00:01:20.369 --> 00:01:22.910
Danny: We didn't know they would get captured.

23
00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:27.451
Bello: I'm sure you didn't, but it's a terrible situation.

24
00:01:27.471 --> 00:01:29.712
Danny: Don't worry.

25
00:01:30.512 --> 00:01:32.993
Everything will be all right after we rescue them.

26
00:01:33.013 --> 00:01:35.834
Danny: It's going to be a great adventure!

27
00:01:40.135 --> 00:01:41.435
Look, ant prints!

28
00:01:41.455 --> 00:01:43.376
Bello: And lots of them.

29
00:01:43.396 --> 00:01:46.257
Danny: I told you everything would be all right.

30
00:01:46.277 --> 00:01:48.057
Bello: You stay here.

31
00:01:48.898 --> 00:01:50.318
I'll go get Tina and Brad.

32
00:01:50.338 --> 00:01:56.860
Danny: I wonder which way the ants went.

33
00:02:02.265 --> 00:02:06.909
Ant 1: Did you hear the news?

34
00:02:06.929 --> 00:02:08.610
Ant 2: No, what news?

35
00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:11.133
Ant 1: It's too amazing to be true.

36
00:02:11.153 --> 00:02:14.836
Danny: Shh.

37
00:02:15.316 --> 00:02:19.019
Listen. Ant 1: There is going to be a new exhibit in the zoo.

38
00:02:19.119 --> 00:02:20.400
Ant 2: Really?

39
00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.481
Ant 1: Yes.

40
00:02:22.002 --> 00:02:24.344
It's a new creature never captured before.

41
00:02:24.364 --> 00:02:28.527
Ant 1: They bought the creatures from the mites.

42
00:02:29.784 --> 00:02:32.105
Tina: Do you think they were talking about the bullies?

43
00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:34.447
Danny: We have to follow them.

44
00:02:35.307 --> 00:02:37.929
Brad: Quickly, before they get too far ahead.

45
00:02:45.293 --> 00:02:46.574
They went down that hole.

46
00:02:46.594 --> 00:02:48.996
Brad: Are we going to follow?

47
00:02:49.676 --> 00:02:50.777
It looks dangerous.

48
00:02:50.797 --> 00:02:53.618
Danny: This is no time to be scared, Brad.

49
00:02:54.479 --> 00:02:55.780
We're on a rescue mission!

50
00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.441
Tina: What did you say to Danny?

51
00:03:03.062 --> 00:03:04.803
He has a positive attitude.

52
00:03:04.824 --> 00:03:07.886
Bello: He's just happy to be having an adventure.

53
00:03:07.906 --> 00:03:11.509
Tina: Well, I like having an adventure too.

54
00:03:11.529 --> 00:03:13.051
Bello: Me too.

55
00:03:13.431 --> 00:03:14.072
Let's go.
